    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Westland is a fictional magical world full of disputes and wars. Diverse cultures coexist on this continent, each race has different beliefs and ideologies, which make confrontations and alliances become the eternal theme here\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers, come to Westland and Join the world of Fourth Age, a free-to-play (f2p) Idle RPG game with a unique social system and SIM play mode! with a turn-based fighting style of Idle Games type. It's the best combination of role-playing games (RPG), strategy, simulation (SIM) and player versus player (PvP) for idle RPG games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=== Features=== </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Non-Stop Fighting &amp; AFK Rewarding\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Idle and battle to get great rewards! With the Idle system, your heroes never stop fighting even when you AFK or log off. Claim rewards and level up your heroes when you return! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Build your own Town Hall\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce special materials, complete orders and increase your Council prosperity with friends and players in the guild, ask for their help and also help them to create a win-win situation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Summon-Collect-Reinforce\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Heroes from 7 factions are waiting for you to summon. Become a grand Summoner, collect and reinforce heroes to assemble the strongest AFK squad! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Battle Arena \u2013 Multiple Modes\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Arena PVP modes, battle with players from all over the world and show off your strength, think with strategies and show everyone your best hero team! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Different Modes - Earn Huge Rewards\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different play modes are waiting for you to challenge, with an interesting Roguelike mode, explore maps and fight for the Treasure rewards! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Westland is a fictional magical world full of disputes and wars. Diverse cultures coexist on this continent, each race has different beliefs and ideologies, which make confrontations and alliances become the eternal theme here\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers, come to Westland and Join the world of Fourth Age, a free-to-play (f2p) Idle RPG game with a unique social system and SIM play mode! with a turn-based fighting style of Idle Games type. It's the best combination of role-playing games (RPG), strategy, simulation (SIM) and player versus player (PvP) for idle RPG games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=== Features=== </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Non-Stop Fighting &amp; AFK Rewarding\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Idle and battle to get great rewards! With the Idle system, your heroes never stop fighting even when you AFK or log off. Claim rewards and level up your heroes when you return! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Build your own Town Hall\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce special materials, complete orders and increase your Council prosperity with friends and players in the guild, ask for their help and also help them to create a win-win situation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Summon-Collect-Reinforce\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Heroes from 7 factions are waiting for you to summon. Become a grand Summoner, collect and reinforce heroes to assemble the strongest AFK squad! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Battle Arena \u2013 Multiple Modes\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Arena PVP modes, battle with players from all over the world and show off your strength, think with strategies and show everyone your best hero team! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Different Modes - Earn Huge Rewards\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different play modes are waiting for you to challenge, with an interesting Roguelike mode, explore maps and fight for the Treasure rewards! </p>",
